@Nurtricenter.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5036

### Health — probed by Consul when service discovery is enabled
GET {{Nurtricenter.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Create courier
POST {{Nurtricenter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/couriers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe"
}

###

### Create route for a courier
POST {{Nurtricenter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "scheduledDate": "2026-10-22"
}

###

### Get a courier's route for today
GET {{Nurtricenter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/couriers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/route/today
Accept: application/json

###
